    "<div><div>\n <div><strong>🎧 FILE NGHE – LISTENING</strong><span>Chưa phát</span></div>\n \n <div><span>0:00</span><span>0:00</span></div>\n  ______ \n <div>\n  ______ </div>\n </div></div>\n      <div>\n        <div>\n          <span>Kỹ năng Nghe</span>\n          <h2>PART A - LISTENING (2,4 pts)</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          🎧 Thiết bị nghe tích hợp\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n\n        <!-- PART A - Section I -->\n        <div>\n          <div>\n            <div>\n              <h3>\n                I. Listen and choose the correct answer A, B, or C (1,2 pts)\n              </h3>\n              <p>Bấm nút \"Phát Audio Bài 1\" bên dưới để nghe bài nói của 3 người.</p>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Audio Controller for Part I -->\n            <div>\n\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Transcript Accordion (Hidden until submission) -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Question 1 to 6 -->\n          <div>\n\n            <!-- Q1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q3 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q4 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q5 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q6 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <div>\n            <div>\n              <h3>\n                II. Listen to Matthew talking to his aunt about his friends. What hobby does each of Matthew’s friends enjoy? (1.2 pts)\n              </h3>\n              <p>Chọn sở thích tương ứng cho từng người bạn của Matthew từ danh sách trong bảng.</p>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Audio Controller for Part II -->\n            <div>\n\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Transcript Accordion Part II (Hidden until submission) -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Table of Friends and Hobbies Dropdowns -->\n          <div>\n            <table>\n              <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <th>#</th>\n                  <th>Friends (Tên bạn)</th>\n                  <th>Hobbies (Sở thích tương ứng)</th>\n                  <th>Trạng thái</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <!-- 1. Christina -->\n                \n\n                <!-- 2. Jason -->\n                \n\n                <!-- 3. Tania -->\n                \n\n                <!-- 4. Steven -->\n                \n\n                <!-- 5. Molly -->\n                \n\n                <!-- 6. Ivan -->\n                \n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>",
    "<div>\n        <span>Kiến thức Ngôn ngữ</span>\n        <h2>PART B. LANGUAGE FOCUS (2,6 pts)</h2>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <!-- Section I: Choose the best answer A, B, C or D -->\n        <div>\n          <h3>\n            I. Choose the best answer A, B, C or D to complete the sentences. (2.0 pts)\n          </h3>\n          <p>Các từ đơn/cụm từ ngắn có hỗ trợ loa 🔊 để nghe phát âm chuẩn.</p>\n\n          <!-- Question 0 (Example from Word Test) -->\n          <div>\n            <div>\n              <span>Ví dụ mẫu</span>\n              <span>0. Nam ________ here three weeks ago.</span>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <div>A. has been</div>\n              <div>B. will be</div>\n              <div>C. was (Đã chọn mẫu)</div>\n              <div>D. is</div>\n            </div>\n            <p>Dấu hiệu: \"three weeks ago\" là thời điểm quá khứ đơn, chủ ngữ \"Nam\" số ít chia \"was\".</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Questions 1 to 10 -->\n          <div>\n\n            <!-- Q1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q3 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q4 (Grammar review - more slowly vs slower) -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q5 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q6 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q7 (Corrected from buggy key: crazy about) -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q8 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q9 (Long options -> NO audio before submission) -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q10 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <h3>\n            II. Give the correct form of the verbs (0,6 pts)\n          </h3>\n          <p>Điền dạng đúng của động từ trong ngoặc vào ô trống.</p>\n\n          <div>\n\n            <!-- Verb 1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Verb 2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Verb 3 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>",
    "<div>\n        <span>Kỹ năng Đọc hiểu</span>\n        <h2>PART C. READING (2.6 pts)</h2>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n\n        <!-- Cloze Reading Passage -->\n        <div>\n          <h3>\n            I. Choose the correct word A, B, C or D for each gap to complete the following passage (1,0 pts)\n          </h3>\n\n          <div>\n            I surf the Internet every day, but I’ve never spent more than <u>(1) ________</u> hour at a time online. I’ve got a laptop and a smartphone, so I can <u>(2) ________</u> the Internet anywhere. Today, for instance, I’ve been online three times. Mainly, I just <u>(3) ________</u> my friends. I read online magazines and I look <u>(4) ________</u> information, too. I also compare prices of things, but I’ve never bought anything online because I <u>(5) ________</u> it’s safe.\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- 5 Cloze Questions -->\n          <div>\n\n            <!-- Cloze 1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Cloze 2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Cloze 3 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Cloze 4 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Cloze 5 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <h3>\n            II. Read the following passage and do as task. (1,6 pts)\n          </h3>\n\n          <!-- Reading Text from Word -->\n          <div>\n            <p>Living in the country is something that people from the city often dream about. However, in reality, it has both advantages and disadvantages.</p>\n            <p>There are certainly many advantages of living in the country. First, you can enjoy peace and quietness. Moreover, people tend to be friendlier. A further advantage is that there is less traffic, so it is safer for young children.</p>\n            <p>However, there are certain disadvantages or drawbacks to life outside the city. First, because there are fewer people, you are likely to have few friends. In addition, entertainment is difficult to find, particularly in the evening. Furthermore, there are fewer shops and services so it is quite hard to find jobs. As a result, you may have to travel a long way to work, which can be extremely expensive.</p>\n            <p>In conclusion, it can be seen that the country is more suitable for some people than others. On the whole, it is often the best place for those who are retired or who have young children. In contrast, young or single people who have a career are better provided for in the city.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Task A: Multiple Choice -->\n          <div>\n            <h4>A. Choose the best answer (0,4 pts)</h4>\n\n            <div>\n              <!-- Q1 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q2 (Long sentence options -> NO audio before submission) -->\n              \n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Task B: Answer the questions -->\n          <div>\n            <h4>B. Answer the following questions (1,2 pts)</h4>\n\n            <div>\n              <!-- Question 1 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Question 2 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Question 3 -->\n              \n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n      </div>",
    "<div>\n        <span>Kỹ năng Viết</span>\n        <h2>PART D. WRITING (1,4 pts)</h2>\n        <p>(Đã tinh giản phần viết đoạn văn theo đúng hướng dẫn)</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n\n        <!-- Section I: Rearrangement with Clickable Boxes -->\n        <div>\n          <div>\n            <h3>\n              I. Put the words in the correct order to make meaningful sentences. (0,6 pts)\n            </h3>\n            <p>\n              Chạm hoặc bấm vào các ô từ/cụm từ bên dưới theo thứ tự đúng để tạo thành câu hoàn chỉnh. Dấu câu cuối câu được hệ thống tự động gán chuẩn.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Rearrange Question 1 -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Rearrange Question 2 -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Rearrange Question 3 -->\n          \n\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <h3>\n            II. Rewrite these sentences so that the meaning stays the same to the first. (0,8 pts)\n          </h3>\n          <p>Điền phần tiếp theo của câu vào ô trống để hoàn thành câu viết lại.</p>\n\n          <div>\n\n            <!-- RW 1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- RW 2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- RW 3 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- RW 4 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>"
